      "content": "It sounds like you are going through a period of profound disconnection and identity crisis, which can feel incredibly isolating and frightening. This \"hollow\" feeling often signals a deep need to reconnect with your core self or what truly brings you meaning. Please know that these intense feelings are a sign that something significant within you is shifting and needs attention. Reaching out to a therapist or trusted friend can provide a much-needed safe space to explore this with someone.",
